<h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold">Crumb, a bakery on the corner</h1>
<p class="mt-3 text-foreground-second">This site has <code>useSiteUrl</code> in <code>nexyconfig.py</code>, so it answers two more addresses. The sitemap lists the three pages of the menu, not the page of each bake: Nexy cannot know the values of <code>[slug]</code>.</p>
